`unknown`, which holds a `weak` field, cannot be passed to another task
an `unknown` may be a `H`, which holds a `weak` field: an interface value may hold anything converted to it in the program
`H`, which has a `weak` field, cannot be passed to another task
an async closure cannot capture `h`, which holds a `weak` field
`Peek`, which holds a `weak` field, cannot be passed to another task
a `Peek` may be a `Named`, which holds a `weak` field: an interface value may hold anything converted to it in the program
`Base`, which holds a `weak` field, cannot be passed to another task
a `Base` may be a `Sub`, which holds a `weak` field: a class value may hold anything converted to it in the program
the function passed to `with` cannot use `h`, which holds a `weak` field
